Brand human review checkpoints
title end

paragraph start
A person reads every AI output that carries the brand name, the voice or a claim before it is used. Any claim is checked against its source, and a claim without a source is removed.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The logo, the name and the palette are only ever approved by the owner.
paragraph end
